-- PREAMBLE --

THIS INSTRUMENT is a commercially issued license, authored by IACONOUS
WORTHYSON under the 75th Avenue licensing framework. It is not the
exclusive property of any work. It is a governing instrument --
available to any inventor, developer, or creator who acquires it -- to
protect and govern the work named in the Certificate of Issuance above.

This Exclusive Edition is the single-tier counterpart to the standard
75th Avenue License. Where the standard instrument grants free,
non-commercial use under an Open Commons tier, this instrument grants
none. Every use of the Works -- commercial or not, for profit or not --
requires a license obtained under Article II. This edition exists for
works the license holder has deliberately chosen to hold under full
commercial control, rather than release any portion to open use.

The Works governed by this specific issuance are defined by the holder
named in the Certificate of Issuance. The license author -- IACONOUS
WORTHYSON -- holds no claim over those Works beyond the right to be
named as the author of this instrument.

